### C1. `CLS-PII-USERNAME-001` — system account username

**Precision problem with the generic pattern:** a naive `(?<![A-Za-z0-9._%+\-])[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9._\-]{2,31}(?![A-Za-z0-9.@])` **over-matches ordinary words, email local-parts and URL path segments** — measured false positives on the sentence *"…contact marcus.vance@example.com and see https://portal.example.com/mavance_admin and administrator"*.

**Context-anchored pattern that justifies ≥0.85 (validated).** Note this is a **capture-group** classifier: the emitted span is **group 1**, not group 0 (group 0 includes the `Account:` label):
```json
