  "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-USERNAME-001",
  "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME",
  "type": "regex",
  "pattern": "(?:\\b(?:Account Name|Username|Account|Login|User)[ \\t]*:[ \\t]*)([a-z][a-z0-9._\\-]{2,31})(?![A-Za-z0-9.@\\-])",
  "span_group": 1,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "confidence_threshold": 0.85,
  "priority": 3,
  "mask_token": "[USERNAME]",
  "validators": [
    { "id": "not_email_localpart", "type": "negative_lookahead_guard", "spec": "reject if followed by '@' or if preceded by an email/URL token boundary" },
    { "id": "label_anchor_required", "type": "context_anchor", "spec": "account|username|login|user label with colon" }
  ]
}
```
Measured behaviour:

| Input | Result |
|---|---|
| `Account: mavance_admin assigned; contact marcus.vance@example.com and see https://portal.example.com/mavance_admin and administrator` | **only** `mavance_admin`, group-1 span `(9,22)`; email, URL path and `administrator` **not** matched |
